2b897babfd1a438b0cd453fe0983", "message": "Div II, 250 points", "created_at": "2013-11-20T23:58:09Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f2897831798843742d6ada45a12d565c5cc73a3", "message": "Div II, 500 points / Div I, 250 points\n\nNumber theory question on primes.\r\n\r\nI pretty quickly solved this one with an O(N*M) solution that was too slow to pass the largest input.  It passed all of the example cases, though: let this be a lesson to myself in the future that if I have a slow algorithm, I should manually enter a test on one of the largest possible inputs to make sure it's fast enough.", "created_at": "2013-11-17T00:25:19Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9dbad6aef8292a6a161ae1481325e3982b6cc940", "message": "Div II, 250 points", "created_at": "2013-11-07T16:35:28Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "be83ab621874a44a2d8356360984a47f3ceb2c63", "message": "Div II, 250 points", "created_at": "2013-11-05T23:36:07Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "37af85c2b193d5cb906068fc332e3df1320922a7", "message": "Div II, 500 points\n\nCalculate moving backwards in a recursive tree.", "created_at": "2013-11-01T23:21:34Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7167798e90c8b0ff81476748e980df8b1388131d", "message": "Div II, 250 points\n\nLesson learned: read the bounds very carefully.  She can't skip the first or last city!", "created_at": "2013-11-01T22:49:58Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "09031d824d952c9f557b121e8a753f8439c3a9db", "message": "Div II, 500 points", "created_at": "2013-10-25T19:09:54Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "361bd6a4ca2b0ec0b65ac4dacd554eb1b835c5ec", "message": "Div II, 250 points", "created_at": "2013-10-25T14:53:20Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4f706fcf2804c03a54d0da61cdc2e23a4309e4cb", "message": "Div II, 250 points", "created_at": "2013-10-17T02:27:11Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "addb42d13e320b3ed065772eff806a080b297655", "message": "Div II, 500 points\n\nOptimal solution taken from the Match Analysis.\r\n\r\nGeneralized for any number of types.", "created_at": "2013-10-10T03:32:42Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "feb470f54a6590b572c333cd75cd5038ff27dcc7", "message": "Div II, 500 points (Suboptimal solution)\n\nNaive approach.  Generates correct output, but is not performance efficient and fails to terminate in <2 seconds for all inputs.", "created_at": "2013-10-10T03:27:38Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6489623a1258e1673d0150861692e5ea90695a29", "message": "Div II, 250 points", "created_at": "2013-10-10T02:45:40Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "953aaaaef55dd417733dc193f96b1d26fe23322a", "message": "Div II, 500 points (actual one)", "created_at": "2013-10-08T02:12:57Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f5a381de54248a5e169a108b042e2d817e72c02", "message": "Div II, 500 points", "created_at": "2013-10-08T00:21:58Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c566c6cbf2c27ae4b152f5f003ea4630ef5c1860", "message": "Div II, 500 points", "created_at": "2013-10-03T01:54:32Z", "repo": "topcoder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bcdd9e2143d9de85b6844f10